# Nine-slice frame, 4px border: mortared stone, the same greys as the walls.
#
# The UI is made of the dungeon rather than laid over it — a menu in any other
# material would be the only object in this game that is not underground.
name roguelike-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key e crypt-4
key d crypt-3
key c crypt-2
key b crypt-1
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oeeeeeeeeeeeeeeo
oeddddddddddddeo
oedccccccccccdeo
*8 oedcbbbbbbbbcdeo
oedccccccccccdeo
oeddddddddddddeo
oddddddddddddddo
oooooooooooooooo
